Package: metaweave
Title: Spatial Ecological Network Inference
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriel", "Munoz", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gabriel.munoz@example.com")
Author: Gabriel Munoz [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Gabriel Munoz <gabriel.munoz@example.com>
Description: A model-agnostic framework for reconstructing and analysing
    spatially explicit ecological networks from species distributions and
    ecological inference models. Supports arbitrary ecological groups and
    includes stochastic block and maximum-entropy inference backends,
    simulation helpers, network summaries, and spatial mapping utilities.
